{"unit_id":"Chruix__dsh-team-model#card-zh","repo":"Chruix/dsh-team-model","commit":"9ccd31b7ec718ad8ebf14bbc3e21e5599386ecd9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-team-model 为 DSH Agent Teams 提供按队友选择模型的能力。它注册 spawn_teammate_with_model 工具，并在 Web 会话头部、输入框工具行和设置页加入模型切换入口。用户可以为单个队友选择模型和推理强度，也可以批量设置整队；模型路由会持续应用，队友离线时可排队到下次启动。适合需要让不同队友使用不同模型的 DSH 团队工作流。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:503-613","index.js:329-500","client.js:779-797"]}
{"unit_id":"Chruix__dsh-team-model#card-en","repo":"Chruix/dsh-team-model","commit":"9ccd31b7ec718ad8ebf14bbc3e21e5599386ecd9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-team-model adds model selection per teammate to DSH Agent Teams. It registers a model-aware spawn tool and adds controls in the session header, composer, and settings. Users can choose a model for one teammate or a whole team. Selections persist across requests; offline changes apply at restart.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:503-613","index.js:329-500","client.js:779-797"]}
